          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/valuation+%28measure+theory%29"} Valuations
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/measures"} measures
            have very similar constructions and applications, with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%24%5Ctau%24-additive+measures"}
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi τ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tau
              \-additive measures
            somewhat in between.
          %p
            Here we review which concepts correspond to each other. Note that on many topological spaces of interest, such as
